@host = http://localhost:5000
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Голосовой ход: ответ — поток SSE (session, audioFormat, transcript, text, audio, toolCalls, done)
POST {{host}}/api/voice
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=yuki

--yuki
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="speech.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./speech.wav
--yuki
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tools"

[]
--yuki--

### Продолжение после toolCalls: результаты ВСЕХ вызовов разом
POST {{host}}/api/voice/tool-results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "results": [
    { "toolCallId": "call_0", "content": "42" }
  ],
  "toolsJson": "[]"
}

### История сессии
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Accept: application/json
